            "title": "Trump Affordability Pitch Heads to Davos Fixed on Greenland",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Trump has vowed to unveil details of a sprawling affordability pitch \u2014 which has landed Wall Street banks, technology companies and home builders in his crosshairs \u2014 during a Wednesday speech at the World Economic Forum.  If he follows through on that pledge, it will come after a weekend in which he put Europe on edge over his increasingly aggressive rhetoric about winning control of Greenland \u2014 and his threat to use tariffs against a host of NATO allies backing the island\u2019s ties to Denmark.  On Monday, with Europeans planning a separate meeting to respond to Trump and Danish officials skipping Davos, the president appeared to be trying to get affordability back on peoples\u2019 minds with social media posts about mortgage rates and his economic agenda.",
